 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the spray at ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"f03eb915-b09a-4907-894a-6f2606648fa2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A ray from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " through ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " is a shortest path from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " that passes through ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " and that no edge prolongs: its last vertex ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 " has no neighbour farther from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " than ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"cc089770-aed3-4b10-b705-1c2e86debddf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The source is ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ". The sinks are the last vertices of the rays. On a finite substrate they \
lie on the rim, and the rays end at different distances from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6c3689ad-0d6f-413c-a29b-e16c82d36cae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The vertices are those of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 " on some ray, and the edges ",
 StyleBox["u \[RightArrow] v", "TI"],
 " step from distance ",
 StyleBox["d(p, u)", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["d(p, u)", "TI"],
 " + 1."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"950f7e13-51ab-4e84-91fd-fd9d6513e67c"],

